$CATEGORY: Vocabulary/HansenQuinn/4/verb

::Q001::[markdown]Which of these forms is based on the **5th Principal Part**?:{
	~%-100%Pluperfect (active)#Incorrect. **Pluperfect (active)** forms are based on the 4th Principal Part, not the 5th.
	~%-100%Present (active, middle, passive)#Incorrect. **Present (active, middle, passive)** forms are based on the 1st Principal Part, not the 5th.
	~%-100%Future (passive)#Incorrect. **Future (passive)** forms are based on the 6th Principal Part, not the 5th.
	~%-100%Future (active, middle)#Incorrect. **Future (active, middle)** forms are based on the 2nd Principal Part, not the 5th.
	~%-100%Aorist (passive)#Incorrect. **Aorist (passive)** forms are based on the 6th Principal Part, not the 5th.
	~%100%Pluperfect (middle/passive)#Correct: **Pluperfect (middle/passive)** forms are based on the 5th Principal Part.
	~%-100%Aorist (active, middle)#Incorrect. **Aorist (active, middle)** forms are based on the 3rd Principal Part, not the 5th.
	~%-100%Imperfect (active, middle, passive)#Incorrect. **Imperfect (active, middle, passive)** forms are based on the 1st Principal Part, not the 5th.
}


::Q002::[markdown]Pick the 1st Principal Part of διδάσκω.:{
	~%-100%φυλάττω#Incorrect. **φυλάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **φυλάττω** “I guard” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ἐδίδαξα#Incorrect. **ἐδίδαξα** is Principal Part 3 of **διδάσκω** “I taught” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἐδιδάχθην#Incorrect. **ἐδιδάχθην** is Principal Part 6 of **διδάσκω** “I was taught” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%πέμπω#Incorrect. **πέμπω** is Principal Part 1 of **πέμπω** “I send” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%δεδίδαγμαι#Incorrect. **δεδίδαγμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **διδάσκω** “I have been taught” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%διδάξω#Incorrect. **διδάξω** is Principal Part 2 of **διδάσκω** “I will teach” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%δεδίδαχα#Incorrect. **δεδίδαχα** is Principal Part 4 of **διδάσκω** “I have taught” (Chapter 4).
	~%100%διδάσκω#Correct: **διδάσκω** is the 1st Principal Part of **διδάσκω** (Chapter 4).
}


::Q003::[markdown]Which of these forms is based on the **2nd Principal Part**?:{
	~%-100%Pluperfect (middle/passive)#Incorrect. **Pluperfect (middle/passive)** forms are based on the 5th Principal Part, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%Pluperfect (active)#Incorrect. **Pluperfect (active)** forms are based on the 4th Principal Part, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%Aorist (active, middle)#Incorrect. **Aorist (active, middle)** forms are based on the 3rd Principal Part, not the 2nd.
	~%100%Future (active, middle)#Correct: **Future (active, middle)** forms are based on the 2nd Principal Part.
	~%-100%Imperfect (active, middle, passive)#Incorrect. **Imperfect (active, middle, passive)** forms are based on the 1st Principal Part, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%Future (passive)#Incorrect. **Future (passive)** forms are based on the 6th Principal Part, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%Perfect (middle/passive)#Incorrect. **Perfect (middle/passive)** forms are based on the 5th Principal Part, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%Perfect (active)#Incorrect. **Perfect (active)** forms are based on the 4th Principal Part, not the 2nd.
}


::Q004::[markdown]I have drawn up (in battle):{
	~%-100%ἀκούω#Incorrect. **ἀκούω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἀκούω** “I hear” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%ἠγγέλθην#Incorrect. **ἠγγέλθην** is Principal Part 6 of **ἀγγέλλλω** “I was announced” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%ἐδούλευσα#Incorrect. **ἐδούλευσα** is Principal Part 3 of **δουλεύω** “I was a slave” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%πράττω#Incorrect. **πράττω** is Principal Part 1 of **πράττω** “I do” (Chapter 5).
	~%-100%ἦρχα#Incorrect. **ἦρχα** is Principal Part 4 of **ἄρχω** “I have ruled” (Chapter 5).
	~%-100%εἴληφα#Incorrect. **εἴληφα** is Principal Part 4 of **λαμβάνω** “I have taken” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%μενῶ#Incorrect. **μενῶ** is Principal Part 2 of **μένω** “I will remain” (Chapter 10).
	~%100%τέταχα#Correct: **τέταχα** is Principal Part 4 of **τάττω** “I have drawn up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q005::[markdown]I wish:{
	~%-100%ἀδικέω#Incorrect. **ἀδικέω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἀδικέω** “I do wrong” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%δέχομαι#Incorrect. **δέχομαι** is Principal Part 1 of **δέχομαι** “I receive” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%δηλώσω#Incorrect. **δηλώσω** is Principal Part 2 of **δηλόω** “I will make clear” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%ἔταξα#Incorrect. **ἔταξα** is Principal Part 3 of **τάττω** “I drew up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἦχα#Incorrect. **ἦχα** is Principal Part 4 of **ἄγω** “I have led” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%ἕμεινα#Incorrect. **ἕμεινα** is Principal Part 3 of **μένω** “I remained” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%ἐκώλῡσα#Incorrect. **ἐκώλῡσα** is Principal Part 3 of **κωλύω** “I hindered” (Chapter 6).
	~%100%ἐθέλω#Correct: **ἐθέλω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἐθέλω** “I wish” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q006::[markdown]Pick the 6th Principal Part of θάπτω.:{
	~%-100%ἐτύθην#Incorrect. **ἐτύθην** is Principal Part 6 of **θύω** “I was sacrificed” (Chapter 3).
	~%100%ἐτάφην#Correct: **ἐτάφην** is the 6th Principal Part of **θάπτω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἔθαψα#Incorrect. **ἔθαψα** is Principal Part 3 of **θάπτω** “I buried” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%θάπτω#Incorrect. **θάπτω** is Principal Part 1 of **θάπτω** “I bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%θάψω#Incorrect. **θάψω** is Principal Part 2 of **θάπτω** “I will bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἐτάχθην#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is Principal Part 6 of **τάττω** “I was drawn up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%τέθαμμαι#Incorrect. **τέθαμμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **θάπτω** “I have been buried” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἐγράφην#Incorrect. **ἐγράφην** is Principal Part 6 of **γράφω** “I was written” (Chapter 3).
}


::Q007::[markdown]ἠθέλησα:{
	~%-100%I have been hurt#Incorrect. **βέβλαμμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **βλάπτω** “I have been hurt” (Chapter 5).
	~%-100%I write#Incorrect. **γράφω** is Principal Part 1 of **γράφω** “I write” (Chapter 3).
	~%100%I was willing#Correct: **ἠθέλησα** is Principal Part 3 of **ἐθέλω** “I was willing” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I have made clear#Incorrect. **δεδήλωκα** is Principal Part 4 of **δηλόω** “I have made clear” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%I was made#Incorrect. **ἐποιήθην** is Principal Part 6 of **ποιέω** “I was made” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%I have been arranged#Incorrect. **τέταγμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **τάττω** “I have been arranged” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I have taken part in a dance#Incorrect. **κεχόρευκα** is Principal Part 4 of **χορεύω** “I have taken part in a dance” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%I will make clear#Incorrect. **δηλώσω** is Principal Part 2 of **δηλόω** “I will make clear” (Chapter 10).
}


