	~%-100%ἔπαυσα#Incorrect. **ἔπαυσα** is Principal Part 3 of **παύω** “I stopped” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ἠδίκηκα#Incorrect. **ἠδίκηκα** is Principal Part 4 of **ἀδικέω** “I have done wrong” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%χορεύω#Incorrect. **χορεύω** is Principal Part 1 of **χορεύω** “I dance” (Chapter 6).
}


