	~%100%τάττω#Correct: **τάττω** is the 1st Principal Part of **τάττω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%θάπτω#Incorrect. **θάπτω** is Principal Part 1 of **θάπτω** “I bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἔταξα#Incorrect. **ἔταξα** is Principal Part 3 of **τάττω** “I drew up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%φυλάττω#Incorrect. **φυλάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **φυλάττω** “I guard” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%τέταγμαι#Incorrect. **τέταγμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **τάττω** “I have been drawn up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%τάξω#Incorrect. **τάξω** is Principal Part 2 of **τάττω** “I will draw up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἐτάχθην#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is Principal Part 6 of **τάττω** “I was drawn up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%τέταχα#Incorrect. **τέταχα** is Principal Part 4 of **τάττω** “I have drawn up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q012::[markdown]The **Future (passive)** forms are based on which Principal Part?:{
	~%-100%2nd#Incorrect. **Future (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%1st#Incorrect. **Future (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**, not the 1st.
	~%-100%5th#Incorrect. **Future (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**, not the 5th.
	~%-100%4th#Incorrect. **Future (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**, not the 4th.
	~%-100%3rd#Incorrect. **Future (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**, not the 3rd.
	~%100%6th#Correct: **Future (passive)** forms are based on the **6th Principal Part**.
}


